<title>USA: Harman International sees 2nd half growth.</title>
<headline>Harman International sees 2nd half growth.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harman International Industries Inc Chairman Sidney Harman said Thursday the company expects &quot;reasonable&quot; growth in the second half despite difficult markets and a strong dollar.</p>
<p>He also said the company is &quot;monitoring the PC markets carefully.&quot;</p>
<p>The executive gave no further details. He made his comments in a press release that contained the company's report of higher fiscal second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The company makes audio equipment for the consumer, professional and OEM markets.</p>
</text>
